prompt:
You are a domain QC analyst. Given this domain: {{domain}}
Wayback snapshots: {{wayback_count}} ({{wayback_years}})
Top anchors: {{anchors}}
Sample page titles: {{titles}}

Score it 1-10 on: 1) Real business history (vs parked spam) 2) PBN risk 3) Brandability. Reject if: contains 'seoexpress', 'pbn', <3 snapshots, or only promo copy. Return JSON: {score, verdict: REAL/MAYBE/SPAM, reason, notes_for_csv}
